# lookup_card_bin_info
**Type:** tool
**Module:** packages.haive-tools.src.haive.tools.tools.binlist_lookup
**Class:** StructuredTool

## Description
Look up card information based on the first 6 to 8 digits (BIN/IIN) using Binlist.net API

## Schema
```json
{
  "$defs": {
    "BinLookupInput": {
      "description": "Input model for the BIN lookup tool.\n\nAttributes:\n    bin_number: The first 6 to 8 digits of a payment card number, also known as\n                the Bank Identification Number (BIN) or Issuer Identification Number (IIN).\n                This identifies the issuing bank or financial institution.",
      "properties": {
        "bin_number": {
          "description": "The first 6 to 8 digits of a card number",
          "title": "Bin Number",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "bin_number"
      ],
      "title": "BinLookupInput",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "description": "Look up information about a payment card based on its BIN/IIN using the Binlist.net API.\n\nArgs:\n    input: A BinLookupInput object containing the bin_number to look up.\n\nReturns:\n    dict: A dictionary containing information about the card, including:\n        - scheme (e.g., visa, mastercard)\n        - type (e.g., debit, credit)\n        - brand\n        - country information\n        - bank information\n        - Or an error message if the BIN is not found\n\nRaises:\n    requests.exceptions.HTTPError: If the API request fails for any reason other than a 404.",
  "properties": {
    "input": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/BinLookupInput"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "input"
  ],
  "title": "lookup_card_bin_info",
  "type": "object"
}
```

## Usage as Tool
**Tool Name:** `lookup_card_bin_info`
**Description:** Look up card information based on the first 6 to 8 digits (BIN/IIN) using Binlist.net API

